        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCCIR19ENTR, Single Cylinder Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circulaire Knob Arc Tall Plate Single Cylinder Entryset is ideal for traditional homes with classic styling. The arched design of the backplate paired with the simple classic Circulaire Knob make for an aesthetically pleasing front door lock. This Single Cylinder Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is easy to install. It is available in a wide array of finish options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/circulaire-knob-with-arc-plate-grandeur-arccir19\"><b>Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Circulaire Knob with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCCIR19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262396\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCCIR19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
